WEBVTT

00:01.460 --> 00:04.960
<b>We found it underneath your son's bed.</b>

00:05.040 --> 00:07.920
<b>There's no way Hitori would kill Micchan.</b>

00:08.000 --> 00:10.880
<b>Hitori didn't do it!</b>

00:11.800 --> 00:12.630
<b>We're...</b>

00:13.130 --> 00:14.470
<b>murderers?</b>

00:14.550 --> 00:17.180
<b>That woman set us up.</b>

00:20.720 --> 00:22.020
<b>Damn her.</b>

00:22.100 --> 00:23.350
<b>Damn her to Hell.</b>

00:23.640 --> 00:24.350
<b>Migi.</b>

00:24.730 --> 00:26.310
<b>Let's expose the Ichijio's.</b>

00:26.900 --> 00:29.530
<b>We'll prove our innocence.</b>

00:29.940 --> 00:31.320
<b>I know that.</b>

00:31.530 --> 00:34.070
<b>We'll pull everything out of them.</b>

00:34.360 --> 00:35.200
<b>And then</b>

00:36.030 --> 00:38.280
<b>we will come back home.</b>

00:41.950 --> 00:43.290
<b>What do we do though?</b>

00:43.540 --> 00:45.710
<b>We're wanted criminals,</b>

00:45.790 --> 00:47.580
<b>and the Ichijos got their guard up.</b>

00:47.670 --> 00:50.250
<b>We can't keep going like before.</b>

00:51.960 --> 00:53.420
<b>We have no choice.</b>

00:53.510 --> 00:54.970
<b>We have to ask him for help.</b>

02:31.360 --> 02:32.690
<b>Hitori...</b>

02:32.770 --> 02:34.190
<b>Where...</b>

02:34.270 --> 02:36.990
<b>in the world are you?</b>

02:39.910 --> 02:41.820
<b>Akiyama... Listen to me.</b>

02:41.910 --> 02:42.700
<b>I'm--</b>

02:46.620 --> 02:48.710
<b>I was so worried.</b>

02:48.790 --> 02:50.620
<b>You were suddenly gone.</b>

02:55.130 --> 02:56.670
<b>I can't believe it.</b>

02:56.760 --> 02:58.550
<b>Eiji's mom did it?</b>

02:59.380 --> 03:00.260
<b>Yeah.</b>

03:00.340 --> 03:02.430
<b>I swear it's the truth.</b>

03:02.760 --> 03:05.560
<b>It sounds incredible,
but I'll take your word for it.</b>

03:05.640 --> 03:07.350
<b>I believe what you say, Hitori.</b>

03:08.350 --> 03:09.810
<b>Please, Akiyama.</b>

03:10.270 --> 03:11.850
<b>Help me.</b>

03:12.440 --> 03:13.520
<b>I got you.</b>

03:13.610 --> 03:14.980
<b>If it's for you,</b>

03:15.070 --> 03:17.070
<b>I'll give my right wing to help.</b>

03:18.320 --> 03:20.700
<b>Though if we're taking on the Ichijos</b>

03:20.780 --> 03:23.030
<b>we need a powerful weapon.</b>

03:24.280 --> 03:25.120
<b>A weapon...</b>

03:25.450 --> 03:26.790
<b>Wait a second, okay?</b>

03:28.120 --> 03:29.370
<b>I got an idea.</b>

03:33.040 --> 03:34.840
<b>Why are you hiding, Dali?</b>

03:35.290 --> 03:38.420
<b>We can't do this just the two of us.</b>

03:39.260 --> 03:41.680
<b>We have to get more people on our team.</b>

03:42.130 --> 03:43.090
<b>Am I wrong?</b>

03:45.390 --> 03:46.470
<b>Hey, Dali.</b>

03:47.060 --> 03:48.970
<b>Akiyama believed me right away.</b>

03:49.930 --> 03:52.600
<b>He'll surely accept both of us.</b>

03:54.350 --> 03:56.440
<b>You're right. It's Akiyama, after all.</b>

04:00.570 --> 04:01.950
<b>Hey! D--</b>

04:05.570 --> 04:06.700
<b>Oh.</b>

04:06.870 --> 04:08.160
<b>It's the murderer.</b>

04:08.240 --> 04:09.120
<b>Mom!</b>

04:10.080 --> 04:11.660
<b>Hitori!</b>

04:13.920 --> 04:15.540
<b>So what you're saying is</b>

04:15.630 --> 04:18.050
<b>the Ichijos are the devil reincarnated</b>

04:18.130 --> 04:21.800
<b>and you need my
superior intelligence to stop them?</b>

04:22.380 --> 04:24.640
<b>Why did you bring him here?</b>

04:24.720 --> 04:27.600
<b>He has the newest
technology in that bag.</b>

04:27.680 --> 04:31.270
<b>We absolutely need it
if we want to take down the Ichijos.</b>

04:35.480 --> 04:37.190
<b>Please, Maruta.</b>

04:37.270 --> 04:39.190
<b>Help me.</b>

04:40.030 --> 04:42.400
<b>It's "Lord Maruta" to you.</b>

04:46.410 --> 04:49.740
<b>Henceforth we shall be "Beavers"!</b>

04:50.540 --> 04:51.540
<b>Boss.</b>

04:51.620 --> 04:52.960
<b>What do you want, minion?</b>

04:53.210 --> 04:57.750
<b>What about pullin' the Ichijos'
little lady over to our crew, eh?</b>

04:57.840 --> 05:01.000
<b>She bailed me outta a tight spot, ya know.</b>

05:01.090 --> 05:03.670
<b>She'd be a slick mole for us, no doubt.</b>

05:05.630 --> 05:06.970
<b>Hmm, Karen?</b>

05:07.300 --> 05:09.220
<b>She seems a little arrogant,</b>

05:09.260 --> 05:10.470
<b>but I guess she's cute.</b>

05:10.560 --> 05:13.560
<b>Though I heard that since it happened</b>

05:13.640 --> 05:17.270
<b>Karen hasn't been to school
nor girlscout meetings.</b>

05:17.560 --> 05:20.320
<b>How do you suggest
we get in touch with her?</b>

05:21.230 --> 05:22.690
<b>Little minions.</b>

05:22.780 --> 05:26.150
<b>Both dams and technology advance rapidly.</b>

05:28.820 --> 05:31.160
<b>I don't trust him.</b>

05:31.240 --> 05:33.580
<b>If things go south he'll betray us for sure.</b>

05:33.660 --> 05:35.120
<b>I know you won't believe it,</b>

05:35.210 --> 05:37.330
<b>but Maruta wants to be your friend.</b>

05:37.420 --> 05:40.590
<b>Him? He just wants
someone he can boss around!</b>

05:40.880 --> 05:42.550
<b>Oh. Look.</b>

05:42.840 --> 05:45.260
<b>It's a cute little racoon dog.</b>

05:49.550 --> 05:50.930
<b>Oh man.</b>

05:51.350 --> 05:53.270
<b>I told you.</b>

05:53.350 --> 05:55.230
<b>We should kick him out</b>

05:55.310 --> 05:56.980
<b>and just take the helicopter.</b>

05:57.060 --> 05:59.650
<b>I want to introduce you
to someone instead.</b>

05:59.730 --> 06:03.230
<b>Someone much better
and much smarter than the rodent.</b>

06:03.320 --> 06:04.280
<b>Hold up.</b>

06:04.360 --> 06:06.700
<b>Maruta's doing something.</b>

06:08.740 --> 06:10.280
<b>He removed his identity!</b>

06:11.200 --> 06:12.580
<b>And put it on the lamp!</b>

06:14.240 --> 06:15.750
<b>Did he lose his mind?</b>

06:26.260 --> 06:27.930
<b>That's Karen's room.</b>

06:28.880 --> 06:30.180
<b>Could it be...</b>

06:30.640 --> 06:32.350
<b>Are they...</b>

06:33.310 --> 06:35.140
<b>They're using morse codes</b>

06:35.220 --> 06:36.770
<b>to talk with each other!</b>

06:46.070 --> 06:49.200
<b>"Can't get out. Door locked."</b>

06:49.280 --> 06:52.780
<b>"Can open window. Come. Will help."</b>

06:52.870 --> 06:53.700
<b>That's all.</b>

06:53.780 --> 06:58.000
<b>You're amazing, Maruta!
You turned a hopeless situation around!</b>

06:58.080 --> 06:59.160
<b>Right, Hitori?</b>

06:59.790 --> 07:00.870
<b>Yeah...</b>

07:00.960 --> 07:03.130
<b>Thanks, Maruta.</b>

07:03.500 --> 07:05.500
<b>Ah. Lord Maruta.</b>

07:09.220 --> 07:10.680
<b>Just say Maruta.</b>

07:18.770 --> 07:21.020
<b>Anyways, how about</b>

07:21.100 --> 07:23.730
<b>we have a strategy meeting
in my secret lair.</b>

07:24.060 --> 07:26.230
<b>That's a good idea.</b>

07:37.120 --> 07:39.580
<b>We have to take Karen hostage.</b>

07:39.660 --> 07:42.830
<b>Right. That will make them fess up.</b>

07:43.170 --> 07:46.090
<b>But how do we get in through that window?</b>

07:46.170 --> 07:48.460
<b>There's police all over the place.</b>

07:48.840 --> 07:52.840
<b>We need a scarecrow,
a stool pigeon, and a videographer...</b>

07:52.930 --> 07:54.050
<b>So</b>

07:54.140 --> 07:57.890
<b>it would be great to have
just one more person to come with us.</b>

07:58.810 --> 08:00.640
<b>One more?</b>

08:00.730 --> 08:01.980
<b>We already do.</b>

08:02.640 --> 08:03.440
<b>What?</b>

08:03.690 --> 08:04.650
<b>Look over there.</b>

08:06.230 --> 08:07.070
<b>Huh?</b>

08:08.030 --> 08:09.360
<b>Did you see a flying pig?</b>

08:20.000 --> 08:21.160
<b>MOM</b>

08:23.750 --> 08:26.540
<b>Cockadoodledoo,
cockadoodledoo, cockadoodledo!</b>

08:28.250 --> 08:29.920
<b>Okay, he's quiet.</b>

08:32.340 --> 08:34.640
<b>So in short, we</b>

08:34.720 --> 08:37.050
<b>pretended to be one person all along.</b>

08:39.140 --> 08:42.310
<b>I can't believe that's
how things were for Hitori.</b>

08:42.390 --> 08:44.020
<b>You frauds.</b>

08:44.100 --> 08:47.020
<b>The two of you have been fooling us.</b>

08:47.110 --> 08:48.190
<b>Maruta.</b>

08:48.270 --> 08:50.780
<b>That's mean--</b>

08:51.070 --> 08:52.030
<b>Are you crying?</b>

08:52.110 --> 08:53.740
<b>The dam is leaking.</b>

08:55.280 --> 08:58.780
<b>Can you keep this between us?</b>

08:58.870 --> 09:00.700
<b>You can't tell
the Sonoyamas either.</b>

09:01.040 --> 09:03.580
<b>I promise. On my heart.</b>

09:04.000 --> 09:05.460
<b>Right, Maruta?</b>

09:07.460 --> 09:10.500
<b>This is a secret lair. Nothing gets out of here.</b>

09:10.590 --> 09:12.090
<b>Oh. You're rewriting it--</b>

09:14.090 --> 09:16.050
<b>Bring the darkness of the Ichijos</b>

09:16.130 --> 09:17.430
<b>into the light.</b>

09:18.390 --> 09:19.510
<b>Let's go.</b>

09:19.890 --> 09:22.470
<b>Be birds!</b>

09:24.640 --> 09:26.900
<b>Let's go home, Inspector.</b>

09:26.980 --> 09:29.570
<b>I already put the kid down as a runaway.</b>

09:31.780 --> 09:32.990
<b>No,</b>

09:33.070 --> 09:35.200
<b>perps always return to the scene.</b>

09:35.650 --> 09:39.620
<b>On a night as quiet as this one,
something is bound to happen.</b>

09:45.580 --> 09:47.710
<b>It's a bird monster!</b>

09:48.210 --> 09:50.040
<b>Wait, look closely.</b>

09:50.130 --> 09:51.420
<b>It has legs.</b>

09:51.670 --> 09:53.670
<b>It might be the boy.</b>

09:53.960 --> 09:57.340
<b>-Apprehend him!
-Wait!</b>

09:57.430 --> 09:59.970
<b>We trust your ability
as a decoy, Akiyama.</b>

10:00.050 --> 10:01.510
<b>Fly, stool pigeon.</b>

10:08.810 --> 10:11.110
<b>Now, for my secret tool...</b>

10:11.980 --> 10:14.320
<b>The tooth that sticks out
gets hammered down.</b>

10:15.190 --> 10:16.780
<b>Focus on the target.</b>

10:17.150 --> 10:18.990
<b>Get out!</b>

10:26.160 --> 10:29.330
<b>A perfect knot. As expected of Karen.</b>

10:29.960 --> 10:32.040
<b>My Beaver gentlemen,</b>

10:32.130 --> 10:34.250
<b>now we shall</b>

10:34.340 --> 10:38.010
<b>cross this bridge
and infiltrate the Ichijo mansion.</b>

10:38.430 --> 10:40.180
<b>You want us to use that flimsy rope?</b>

10:40.550 --> 10:44.060
<b>It was made by me,
the scout with perfect attendance.</b>

10:44.520 --> 10:46.350
<b>Just watch, you chicken.</b>

10:47.940 --> 10:52.560
<b>Wiggle-waggle, wiggle-waggle....</b>

10:56.320 --> 10:59.110
<b>You're too slow, Maruta. We'll get caught.</b>

10:59.200 --> 11:00.660
<b>Wigglewaggle.</b>

11:00.740 --> 11:02.570
<b>You're such amateurs.</b>

11:02.910 --> 11:07.200
<b>This kind of thing should be
done leisurely, while enjoying nature.</b>

11:07.790 --> 11:10.290
<b>Whoa, that was close.</b>

11:11.960 --> 11:13.540
<b>Barbed wire?</b>

11:15.000 --> 11:16.960
<b>If we fall, it's over for us.</b>

11:17.050 --> 11:18.550
<b>Let's hurry up and cross it.</b>

11:20.380 --> 11:21.260
<b>Maruta?</b>

11:24.050 --> 11:25.930
<b>Stop it, don't shake it.</b>

11:26.010 --> 11:27.930
<b>We'll fall down.</b>

11:31.810 --> 11:33.190
<b>Crap, the branch is giving in.</b>

11:34.690 --> 11:36.730
<b>Maruta, come on, keep going!</b>

11:40.740 --> 11:41.820
<b>Dangit.</b>

11:46.290 --> 11:48.000
<b>Go!</b>

11:52.750 --> 11:53.540
<b>Dali!</b>

11:57.590 --> 12:00.010
<b>-Why are you not moving--
-I'll fall.</b>

12:01.090 --> 12:03.640
<b>I can't keep going.</b>

12:17.070 --> 12:17.940
<b><i>Migi?</i></b>

12:20.030 --> 12:21.950
<b>What are you doing?</b>

12:22.030 --> 12:24.780
<b>Making our weight become zero.</b>

12:25.370 --> 12:28.240
<b>Okay, Dali. Let's keep going.</b>

12:28.660 --> 12:31.080
<b>Migi. You...</b>

12:32.290 --> 12:35.040
<b>You've gotten fat. It's unbalanced.</b>

12:35.130 --> 12:37.090
<b>What? Jesus, Dali.</b>

12:37.170 --> 12:39.210
<b>You're so arrogant.</b>

12:43.050 --> 12:46.220
<b>It looks like my growth spurt
came earlier than yours.</b>

12:46.300 --> 12:47.470
<b>Whatever you say.</b>

12:52.230 --> 12:57.110
<b>I've never before received
such romantic morse codes.</b>

12:57.190 --> 12:59.860
<b>Well... ti amorse.</b>

13:07.570 --> 13:11.790
<b>He lay on his belly
for the first time today.</b>

13:11.870 --> 13:14.830
<b>At this rate, he'll start crawling soon.</b>

13:14.920 --> 13:18.130
<b>And then next thing he'll be standing up.</b>

13:18.630 --> 13:21.000
<b>I'm so excited for him to grow up.</b>

13:21.460 --> 13:24.510
<b>My cute little Eiji.</b>

13:29.180 --> 13:31.560
<b>I'll act as a hostage?</b>

13:32.100 --> 13:34.980
<b>If her daughter's life is on the line,
even that woman</b>

13:35.060 --> 13:36.400
<b>will fess up, won't she?</b>

13:37.400 --> 13:38.810
<b>I'm not so sure.</b>

13:38.900 --> 13:41.400
<b>I'm not sure I'll be enough.</b>

13:42.820 --> 13:46.490
<b>My brother resembles our father,
so if it's him, then maybe...</b>

13:46.860 --> 13:49.580
<b>What do you mean?</b>

13:50.080 --> 13:53.700
<b>What is the deal with that woman?</b>

13:55.000 --> 13:57.170
<b>Something always felt off.</b>

13:58.380 --> 14:00.960
<b>As if we were just playing happy family.</b>

14:01.040 --> 14:02.840
<b>And then by coincidence,</b>

14:02.920 --> 14:05.340
<b>Mitchan looked into that something.</b>

14:05.880 --> 14:09.890
<b>And I remember once I knew
that woman isn't really my mom</b>

14:09.970 --> 14:12.810
<b>I felt so relieved.</b>

14:13.810 --> 14:16.890
<b>She wants everything to be perfect.</b>

14:16.980 --> 14:19.690
<b>Both her family,
and the village, and her life</b>

14:19.770 --> 14:22.480
<b>has to be like a perfect set of cutlery.</b>

14:26.360 --> 14:29.280
<b>Please bring ruin to this house.</b>

14:29.620 --> 14:31.160
<b>Bring ruin?</b>

14:31.240 --> 14:33.240
<b>I'll bring complete ruin.</b>

14:33.620 --> 14:35.200
<b>No matter what it takes.</b>

14:38.500 --> 14:39.630
<b>Maruta.</b>

14:39.710 --> 14:40.630
<b>Karen.</b>

14:44.050 --> 14:47.420
<b>Anyways, how do we make Eiji our hostage?</b>

14:47.510 --> 14:49.090
<b>We can't leave this room.</b>

14:49.680 --> 14:50.760
<b>Leave it to me.</b>

14:50.840 --> 14:52.640
<b>I am a master at playing pretend.</b>

15:04.820 --> 15:06.190
<b>It hurts! It hurts!</b>

15:06.280 --> 15:07.900
<b>-My tummy hurts!
-Karen!</b>

15:07.990 --> 15:09.570
<b>What's wrong? Where does it hurt?</b>

15:11.410 --> 15:12.910
<b>The duodenum.</b>

15:13.410 --> 15:16.080
<b>Ah, I see, the duodenum.</b>

15:18.410 --> 15:19.870
<b>Where are you going?</b>

15:19.960 --> 15:21.880
<b>You're leaving behind the director.</b>

15:21.960 --> 15:23.250
<b>Just follow us.</b>

15:23.340 --> 15:24.090
<b>Pffh.</b>

15:25.090 --> 15:27.630
<b>My brother isn't in his room.</b>

15:27.710 --> 15:30.800
<b>He's being given re-education.</b>

15:31.930 --> 15:34.390
<b>So Eiji is...</b>

15:34.680 --> 15:36.010
<b>Inside this room.</b>

15:43.610 --> 15:44.900
<b>Eiji...</b>

15:45.610 --> 15:47.650
<b>Why is Eiji like this?</b>

15:53.700 --> 15:55.580
<b>Oh no, she'll come here.</b>

15:59.660 --> 16:02.750
<b>What is this family?</b>

16:02.830 --> 16:03.920
<b>They're crazy.</b>

16:04.590 --> 16:05.540
<b>That's right.</b>

16:06.340 --> 16:08.010
<b>This is the idolized</b>

16:09.550 --> 16:11.050
<b><i>Ichijo family.</i></b>

16:17.060 --> 16:19.520
<b>It's actually good for us
that he's been babyfied.</b>

16:19.890 --> 16:22.100
<b>We'll kidnap him while he's defenseless.</b>

16:22.190 --> 16:23.900
<b>Then interrogate her.</b>

16:24.520 --> 16:26.230
<b>To do that, we have to</b>

16:27.230 --> 16:29.190
<b>bring Eiji upstairs.</b>

16:29.530 --> 16:30.530
<b>What?</b>

16:30.610 --> 16:32.740
<b>Why do we have to do that?</b>

16:32.820 --> 16:34.660
<b>Let's just stay here.</b>

16:34.740 --> 16:36.160
<b>Maruta.</b>

16:36.240 --> 16:38.620
<b>You don't know that woman.</b>

16:38.700 --> 16:41.960
<b>In here, she'll snap our necks
in the blink of an eye.</b>

16:45.420 --> 16:48.880
<b>We have to keep a safe distance to her.</b>

16:49.800 --> 16:52.090
<b><i>Then we'll threaten her</i>
<i>from the first floor.</i></b>

16:52.170 --> 16:54.090
<b><i>I told you not to underestimate her.</i></b>

16:54.380 --> 16:55.590
<b><i>She'll squash us.</i></b>

16:55.840 --> 16:58.310
<b><i>So we have to be on the second floor</i></b>

16:59.350 --> 17:02.140
<b><i>and have her be downstairs.</i></b>

17:02.600 --> 17:05.270
<b><i>That's the most</i>
<i>safe way for us to do this.</i></b>

17:05.730 --> 17:08.020
<b>Migi and I will bring Eiji upstairs</b>

17:08.110 --> 17:09.730
<b>and hide from view.</b>

17:10.150 --> 17:14.200
<b>Meanwhile you'll make noise
to make her go downstairs.</b>

17:15.070 --> 17:18.780
<b>Then you just hide
and film everything that happens.</b>

17:19.370 --> 17:21.250
<b>Okay, I got you.</b>

17:21.330 --> 17:22.870
<b>That's a piece of cake.</b>

17:25.250 --> 17:26.290
<b>Don't be afraid.</b>

17:26.670 --> 17:28.290
<b>We're Beavers.</b>

17:28.380 --> 17:29.880
<b>We fear nothing.</b>

17:31.210 --> 17:32.710
<b>Just as Migi said.</b>

17:33.130 --> 17:34.970
<b>You promised Karen, right?</b>

17:35.050 --> 17:36.390
<b>To bring ruin no matter what.</b>

17:37.930 --> 17:38.800
<b>Yes.</b>

17:39.640 --> 17:41.180
<b>Bring Ichijo's darkness</b>

17:41.270 --> 17:42.140
<b>into the light.</b>

17:45.980 --> 17:48.610
<b>Okay, slowly now.</b>

17:57.320 --> 17:59.870
<b>I can't believe you can
look at Eiji like that.</b>

18:01.410 --> 18:03.000
<b>Hey, Dali.</b>

18:03.080 --> 18:05.120
<b>What do you think about Eiji right now?</b>

18:05.210 --> 18:08.290
<b>Do you still want to kill him?</b>

18:09.670 --> 18:11.090
<b>What about you?</b>

18:11.960 --> 18:13.880
<b>I think before I would have</b>

18:13.960 --> 18:15.800
<b>taken pictures of him and</b>

18:15.880 --> 18:17.970
<b>spread it out in the entire school.</b>

18:19.600 --> 18:20.800
<b>But now...</b>

18:21.640 --> 18:24.600
<b>He's the one who killed our mother.</b>

18:25.680 --> 18:27.940
<b>But he saved me twice.</b>

18:28.600 --> 18:30.400
<b><i>First, from the pumpkin,</i></b>

18:31.060 --> 18:32.610
<b><i>then from the baguette.</i></b>

18:33.150 --> 18:34.070
<b>A baguette?</b>

18:35.150 --> 18:35.780
<b>Oh no.</b>

18:41.160 --> 18:43.540
<b>Oh no Dali, he's fed up with my face.</b>

18:43.620 --> 18:46.460
<b>Dali, you try making a face at him.</b>

18:57.090 --> 19:00.010
<b>What kind of face was that, Dali?</b>

19:01.260 --> 19:02.720
<b>I don't know.</b>

19:02.970 --> 19:05.020
<b>I don't know how to face him.</b>

19:08.100 --> 19:11.400
<b><i>Once those two have taken Eiji upstairs,</i></b>

19:11.480 --> 19:14.110
<b><i>I'll close the key cover</i>
<i>of the piano loudly,</i></b>

19:14.570 --> 19:16.530
<b><i>and then quickly hide.</i></b>

19:16.610 --> 19:18.610
<b><i>It's a piece of cake.</i></b>

19:25.950 --> 19:28.210
<b><i>Maruta!</i></b>

19:28.580 --> 19:31.000
<b><i>No way. Not already!</i></b>

19:59.820 --> 20:01.740
<b>She went to the confinement room.</b>

20:01.820 --> 20:02.870
<b>It's now or never.</b>

20:09.540 --> 20:11.540
<b>Maruta, please, help us here.</b>

20:12.120 --> 20:13.130
<b>Maruta.</b>

20:17.880 --> 20:18.880
<b>There's no way.</b>

20:19.510 --> 20:20.550
<b>He...</b>

20:20.630 --> 20:22.090
<b>betrayed us.</b>

20:26.600 --> 20:29.220
<b>Eiji! Eiji!</b>

20:29.310 --> 20:31.690
<b>Where are you? Where?</b>

20:31.940 --> 20:33.400
<b>Eiji! Eiji!</b>

20:34.560 --> 20:35.860
<b>Eiji!</b>

20:40.780 --> 20:43.280
<b>Oh, there you are.</b>

20:43.360 --> 20:45.990
<b>I found you.</b>

20:53.000 --> 20:55.210
<b>The test shoot isn't too shabby.</b>

20:55.290 --> 20:57.500
<b>Though the angle isn't good.</b>

20:58.250 --> 21:02.260
<b>We need an angle that
really shows the female lead.</b>

21:04.550 --> 21:06.010
<b>It has to be like this.</b>

21:08.470 --> 21:09.310
<b>Maruta.</b>

21:09.390 --> 21:10.720
<b>Took you long enough.</b>

21:10.810 --> 21:11.810
<b>You...</b>

21:11.890 --> 21:13.940
<b>Of course I wouldn't betray you.</b>

21:14.520 --> 21:16.190
<b>We've made a pact, haven't we?</b>

21:18.230 --> 21:19.020
<b>Yes.</b>

21:21.610 --> 21:22.820
<b>You, woman.</b>

21:22.900 --> 21:25.320
<b>Don't make me spill
the blood of your child.</b>

21:27.120 --> 21:29.620
<b>Tell the truth.</b>

21:29.700 --> 21:31.790
<b>About our mother.</b>

21:31.870 --> 21:34.210
<b>And the sin you committed.</b>

21:34.620 --> 21:35.500
<b>About it all.</b>

23:18.230 --> 23:21.480
<b>You truly are Metry's children.</b>

23:21.940 --> 23:22.980
<b>What?</b>

23:23.230 --> 23:25.860
<b>Fine. I will tell you.</b>

23:29.780 --> 23:32.160
<b>This is the story of Metry,</b>

23:32.820 --> 23:33.620
<b>that is to say,</b>

23:34.490 --> 23:37.660
<b>the story of a devil.</b>
